...and it's not always due to a lack of support from software companies. My
group is the only one at Adobe that has an Alpha product (Color Central NT
- an OPI/print server). DEC is obviously rather eager for Adobe to port our
applications to the Alpha - especially Photoshop, for which there is
already an NT version. So you'd think that when we asked DEC for a
short-term loaner, they might be able to help out. WRONG! Even when we
